# Admin Dashboard Copy

- Treat the FixWheel admin dashboard as an operations tool, not a marketing page.
- Do not add hero statements, promotional copy, tutorial paragraphs, decorative subtitles, or text that merely explains what the visible controls and data already show.
- Prefer compact page titles, precise field labels, status text, and action labels.
- Add explanatory copy only when it prevents an operational mistake or resolves genuine ambiguity; keep it to one short sentence.
- Preserve required validation, error, loading, empty, and accessibility text.
